2.)

The flow we originally designed was:

Business owner needs a service → finds provider → sends a request → provider sends a quote → business accepts → booking → service completed → review.

So the key distinction is:
ServiceRequest = the business is requesting work
Quote = the provider responds with their price/proposal
Booking = the business has accepted the provider's quote and hired them

